span style=\"font-size:11px\">&nbsp;We are taking glass pannel width in partition upto 1200 mm only,if changes in above width&nbsp; &nbsp;required at site than inform us before glass measurment,if any additional cost arise from this will not be paid by us</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"background-color:#FF0000\">GLASS WILL BE HAVING BEND UPTO 1MM TO 6MM PER MTR</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"background-color:#FF0000\">&nbsp;INSTALLATION SCHEDULE IS SUBJECT TO PAYMENT</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Delivery Schedule : 15 days after receiving PO and advance</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Validity of Quotation: 15 Days from the date of this quotation</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n', '<ol>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;Gst is payable extra as actual, if not included in quote</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;Any other levies and taxes, if any as mandated by the statuary authorities from time to time, at time of placing of order shall be payable extra, and is not included in quoted price (unless specified)</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n', '<p><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><strong>Security for physical material</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">It is the responsibility of the client for security of physical material lying at site. The liability from our side ceases as soon as the acknowledged of receipt of physical material duly signed by authorized representative of client. Once the duly acknowledged received at site will not be returnable under any circumstances</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><strong>Jurisdiction</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">All disputes shall be subject to Mumbai jurisdiction only</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n', 'Testing 1', 'Arcon Partition', '', 0),
